{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id120906576"}, "name":{"label":"K_Zazz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-30T09:04:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.3"}, "id":{"label":"14490461289"}, "title":{"label":"Best app I’ve ever bought"}, "content":{"label":"I have for months been resigning myself to the fact that I probably just need to get a dumb phone to curb social media and YouTube’s impact on my life and time. Then this app came into my awareness and changed everything. Truly, if you’re worried about screen time, this is the app for you. \n\nThe setup instructions are easy to follow and I can’t believe what a difference it’s made in the last month or so since I bought it. I went from hours of scrolling to…maybe half an hour a day maximum? The interventions are just inconvenient and effective enough to really work, and having to write my intention for using social media every time is a game changer.  At night, I put it on a reoccurring strict mode and it’s also revolutionized my sleep. No more getting sucked down late night YouTube rabbit holes. \n\nIt is exactly what I’ve been wanting and I’m so grateful I found it 🙏 truly, if you’re also struggling, get this app. It’s more than worth your money for the full version", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
