{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id287694852"}, "name":{"label":"wisetypewriter"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-22T13:04:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"13876264065"}, "title":{"label":"Exactly what it says on the tin"}, "content":{"label":"The web extension is great, and the macOS app is very useful as well. Setting block times, apps to block has been very helpful in claiming back my time. It would also be cool to customize the intervention types / text like on web too, regardless though, it gets the job done!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id118802702"}, "name":{"label":"elmputnam"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-20T17:54:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2"}, "id":{"label":"13869797246"}, "title":{"label":"Intentional App Switching Needs Work"}, "content":{"label":"Great app overall, but switching between apps or going back after being interrupted, is frustrating. if i’m googling something to fact check myself before commenting, it always puts me thru the intervention again as if i’m starting a new session.  or if i have to lock my phone to do something and come back, it treats it as if i was gone for more than the 10 minute time limit EVERY time. super frustrating and heavily inflates the number of times you’ve tried to start an app within the last 24 hours. it sounds like no big deal, but it has me considering switching to another similar app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
