{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id477475468"}, "name":{"label":"CJI97"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-06T13:08:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"13365191423"}, "title":{"label":"Very Good Strict Blocker"}, "content":{"label":"I was looking for an iOS blocker that’s the equivalent of Cold Turkey on PC to no avail. But one sec is as close to it as it comes. It’s strict block blocks all apps designate according to regardless of you whether you “feel” like it or not. The built in friction is amazing to keep you on track. If you guys on the dev team could add the randomized word password required to reset any strict blocks, this would be a 10/10.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
