{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id202998250"}, "name":{"label":"Marsha (Yes Yes Marsha)"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-08T05:42:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"13239750076"}, "title":{"label":"Changed my life & made me happier and more productive"}, "content":{"label":"I have a dreadful phone addiction and in spite of numerous methods to curb it — even going so far as moving my SIM card into a flip phone — I have been challenged by how often the siren song of phone-checking sings to me and pulls me in. \n\nThanks to One Sec, I have got hours of my life back, for productivity and FUN. Some real life happens on the phone but rarely (for me) on email or social media. One Sec has helped me spend more time on the things that I ACTUALLY want to. \n\nNo hyperbole to say that this app has changed my life & made me happier and more productive. Thank you, One Sec!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
